window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>He's the star hockey player, my brother's best friend, and the boy I've been in love with since I was 7.</b></p> <p>The problem? He wants nothing to do with me.</p> <p>Then why does he sneak into my room when I have a nightmare? Get jealous when I go on a date? And has a tattoo of my birthday on his ribs?</p> <p>Lucas Knight's a lot of things. He's possessive, jealous and overprotective. And he just might be in love with me.</p> <p>Angst-filled, heartbreaking, and kick-your-feet-in-the-air-giddy-inducing.</p> <p>This is a standalone book in the Rule Breaker interconnected series.</p>"; 
